]},{"t":" "},{"t":"images","s":["H6754"],"a":[12]},{"t":" and demolish all their high "},{"t":"places","s":["H1116"],"a":[17]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":53,"text":"And you shall take possession of the land and dwell in it, for to you I have given the land to possess it.","tok":[{"t":"And you shall take possession of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in it, for to you I have "},{"t":"given","s":["H5414"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"possess","s":["H3423"],"a":[10]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":54,"text":"And you shall inherit the land by lot according to your families; to the larger you shall give a larger inheritance, and to the smaller you shall give a smaller inheritance. Wherever the lot falls to anyone, that shall be his. You shall inherit according to the tribes of your fathers.","tok":[{"t":"And you shall inherit the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"lot","s":["H1486"],"a":[3]},{"t":" according to your "},{"t":"families","s":["H4940"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; to the larger you shall give a larger "},{"t":"inheritance","s":["H5159"],"a":[8]},{"t":", and to the smaller you shall give a smaller "},{"t":"inheritance","s":["H5159"],"a":[12]},{"t":". Wherever the "},{"t":"lot","s":["H1486"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"falls","s":["H3318"],"a":[15]},{"t":" to anyone, that shall be his. You shall "},{"t":"inherit","s":["H5157"]},{"t":" according to the "},{"t":"tribes","s":["H4294"],"a":[21]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"fathers","s":["H0001"],"a":[22]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":55,"text":"But if you do not drive out the inhabitants of the land from before you, then those whom you let remain of them will become as splinters in your eyes and as thorns in your sides, and they will trouble you in the land in which you are dwelling.","tok":[{"t":"But if you do not drive "},{"t":"out","s":["H3423"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"inhabitants","s":["H3427"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{